<details id="imagex-proposal-panel" class="imagex-brief-proposal" hidden>
  <summary>Review the brief proposal</summary>
  <p class="image-help">Compare and adjust this text. “Apply” replaces your brief; only the “Create” button starts the render.</p>
  <div id="imagex-proposal">
    <p id="imagex-proposal-empty" class="image-help">Use “Refine my brief” to get a proposal suited to the chosen recipe and format.</p>
    <div id="imagex-proposal-content" hidden><p id="imagex-proposal-reason"></p><p id="imagex-proposal-settings" class="image-help"></p>
      <details><summary>Compare with my initial brief</summary><pre id="imagex-proposal-original" class="imagex-protected-constraints"></pre></details>
      <label for="imagex-proposal-prompt">Proposed brief · editable</label><textarea id="imagex-proposal-prompt" rows="7" aria-describedby="imagex-apply-note"></textarea>
      <p id="imagex-proposal-counter" class="image-help" role="status"></p>
      <pre id="imagex-proposal-constraints" class="imagex-protected-constraints" aria-label="Kept user constraints" hidden></pre>
      <div id="imagex-proposal-text-plan" class="image-text-plan" hidden></div>
      <button id="imagex-apply" type="button">Apply this proposal to the brief</button><p id="imagex-apply-note" class="image-help">Then check the brief and the references, and start the creation.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</details>
